\newlabel{tab:ar-scale}{{1}{4}{Cross-check on Qwen3-32B verifier, $b{=}1$, $k{=}4$, GSM8K: decode throughput (tok/s) as AR drafter size scales. \emph {AR} is target-only autoregressive decoding; \emph {SD} adds the AR drafter; \emph {SSD} adds SSD overlap on top}{table.caption.2}{}}
\newlabel{tab:main}{{2}{4}{Main regime (output length 32, $2{\times }$H100, Qwen3-8B verifier, greedy decode) by family and mode. \emph {Exact-off} is the same drafter under standard SD (no overlap); \emph {Oracle} is the SSD architectural ceiling; \emph {Realized} is the actual async system}{table.caption.3}{}}
